      en: ["The plant has a total installed capacity of 2,334 megawatts.", "Construction of the power plant lasted from 1962 until completion in 1969.", "The facility consists of 12 power units, each with approx. 200 MW capacity.", "The highest chimney of the plant measures 250 meters in height.", "The 'Burshtyn Island' enabled electricity export to the EU power grid.", "The plant is located by the Burshtyn Reservoir, which provides cooling water."],
