      en: ["The plant was founded in 1956 to exploit the Malyshevske deposit.", "It is one of the world's largest producers of zircon concentrate.", "The primary products include ilmenite, rutile, zircon, and kyanite-sillimanite.", "VGMK supplies the global aerospace industry with titanium raw materials.", "The facility features its own research department for mineral processing.", "The city of Vilnohirsk was originally established as a settlement for miners."],
