      en: ["The company was officially established on May 31, 1946.", "Antonov designed the An-225, the heaviest aircraft ever to fly.", "The An-124 Ruslan can carry a payload of up to 150 tons.", "The factory site in Kyiv features its own takeoff and landing runway.", "More than 22,000 Antonov aircraft have been built worldwide in total.", "Antonov Airlines has transported components for satellites and trains."],
